  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Swer">Swer</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">On lifiendes Godes naman, ne ðearf ic N. sceatt ne scylling, ne penig ne peniges weorð, ac eal ic him gelæste ðæt ðæt ic him scolde, swa forð swa uncre wordgecwydu fyrmest wæron.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[I swear] in the name of the living God, [that] I owe N. neither coin nor shilling, penny or pennyworth; but all that I owed I have paid him, just as our initial agreement said.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Andsæcc. On lifiendes Godes naman, ne ðearf ic N. sceatt ne scylling, ne pænig ne pæniges weorð, ac eal ic him gelæste þæt ðæt ic him scolde, swa forð swa uncre wordgecwydu fyrmest wæron.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
